pe":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_29","text":"Although we operate within the criminal world,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_30","text":"our ultimate goal is to safeguard the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_31","text":"In that sense, we serve a function similar to Exotic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_32","text":"I am the head of Seimeikai, the oldest of the three organizations. It has existed since the Ark was first created.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["sakura","moran","rosanna"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_33","text":"Moran runs the Peony Association. They also refer to themselves as the Templars. They are few in number.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_cherryblossom_intermission_01_34","text":"Hedonia is led by Rosanna. This gang has been on an upward trajectory for a while